        1692,
        2147
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a76. Other Municipal Departments and Agencies.\nA copy of this order will be sent to the chief officer of each department and agency not within the Mayor's administrative jurisdiction with the request that they cooperate in achieving the objectives of this order, that they voluntarily apply all applicable sections to the administration of automobiles owned or operated by them, and that they seek to establish a working relationship with the Vehicular Control Board.",
